        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "啟用「無姓名時使用公司名稱」後，加入拼音時會將公司名稱寫入沒有姓氏和名字的聯絡人的名字欄位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These options apply the next time you clear contact fields. Selected fields will be emptied, including text you entered manually. Select Common Fields controls the eight fields from Nickname through Name Suffix; social profiles and instant messaging accounts are managed separately." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "These options apply the next time you clear contact fields. Selected fields will be emptied, including text you entered manually. Select Common Fields controls the eight fields from Nickname through Name Suffix; social profiles and instant messaging accounts are managed separately."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些选项在下次清除联系人字段时生效。选中字段的内容会被清空，包括手动输入的文字。“选择常用字段”仅控制昵称至姓名后缀这八项，社交资料和即时通讯账号需单独设置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些選項會在下次清除聯絡人欄位時生效。所選欄位的內容會被清空，包括手動輸入的文字。「選取常用欄位」僅控制暱稱至姓名後綴這八項，社群個人檔案和即時通訊帳號需另外設定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
